From a13f80f742d75302a21e2ca85e3d596c3c276a83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mauro Carvalho Chehab <mchehab+huawei@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:20:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rasdaemon: ensure DB is opened before handing events

While testing MCE fatal errors storing events at pstore and
letting rasdaemon pick such events, a race condition was noticed:
at the time ERST logic picks the logs, the database was not ready
to store errors, causing report only at console.

Fix it by adding a new registration module that ensures that all
databases are opened before start receiving events.

Signed-off-by: Mauro Carvalho Chehab <mchehab+huawei@kernel.org>
---
